Commit:     John Bieling <john@thunderbird.net>
CommitDate: Fri Jun 27 17:36:56 2025 +0000

    Bug 1967386 - Enable support for ews accounts in WebExtension APIs. r=edicharry,babolivier

    This patch adds general support for "ews" accounts to the `accounts API`
    and the `folders API`, including the required test infrastructure. Not
    all operations are supported. Support for "ews" accounts is still
    preliminary.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D252640

